            title: 'High Card Flush',
            subtitle: 'Card Game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'High Card Flush is a popular casino table game that focuses exclusively on flushes. Unlike standard poker, straights, pairs, and other hands do not matter. The goal is simply to have more cards of the same suit in a seven-card hand than the dealer. It combines simplicity with high-payout bonus bets.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Introduced in US casinos (notably in Nevada and Atlantic City) in the early 2010s. It was designed to provide a proprietary table game that was easier to understand than traditional poker-based games.',
              },
            ],
          },
